<title>USA: Jack Henry buys Liberty Banking Services.</title>
<headline>Jack Henry buys Liberty Banking Services.</headline>
<dateline>MONETT, Mo. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jack Henry &amp; Associates Inc said Monday it purchased Liberty Banking Services Inc, which serves 13 banks in the Denver area.</p>
<p>The $2.0 million stock transaction will be accounted for as a pooling of interests.</p>
<p>Michael Henry, chairman, said the transaction would enhance the company's presence in the Rocky Mountain region.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
